{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123106","id":4422874799,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABB5-2rw","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123106","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123106.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123106.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123106","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123106/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123106/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123106/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/040a583189aaa66bcba5dacae9901e6a0bd150e7","number":123106,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add String/StringName property hint for audio bus selection","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- De-duplicates code for handling audio bus properties\r\n- Allows end users to expose their own audio bus properties with `@export_custom(PROPERTY_HINT_AUDIO_BUS, \"\") var bus : StringName = &\"Master\"`\r\n- Helps remove a core hack in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111455#discussion_r3912429750\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nTested briefly and it seems to work, but more testing would be welcome.\r\n\r\nA few things to note:\r\n\r\n- When inspecting a node with an audio bus property and editing audio buses at the same time, it won't automatically refresh the drop-down in the inspector until re-selecting the node. That's pretty much how most dynamic stuff works in Godot so I guess it's working as intended?\r\n- We can discuss what to do if a serialized bus name is no longer found. The current code keeps the old name as is and just selects nothing when opening the drop-down, so in case it gets re-added/renamed, nothing is lost. An alternative would be to force fallback to `Master`. On the getter side, there is already some logic to fall back to `Master` if the property points to a non-existing bus.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"